<Base title="About Jevan Goldsmith" description="Meet Jevan Goldsmith: writing about attention, work and life, starting a pet food business, and keeping a collection of books, projects and travels." canonical="https://jevangoldsmith.com/about.html" pageType="AboutPage">
  <main class="publication about-page">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">The person behind the writing</p><h1>Hi, I’m Jevan.</h1></header>
    <img class="about-portrait" src="/images/generated/profile/profile-360.jpg" alt="Jevan Goldsmith" width="360" height="393" />
    <div class="prose"><p>I’m currently working on a pet food business. Alongside that, I read, make things, travel, and write about what’s on my mind.</p><p>This site is where those interests come together. The essays explore attention, culture and change. The collections hold the books, projects and places I keep coming back to.</p><h2>What you’ll find here</h2><p><a href="/start-here.html">Start Here</a> introduces the writing. <a href="/essays.html">Essays</a> holds the archive, while <a href="/updates.html">notes from the work</a> includes shorter pieces and practical exercises.</p><p>For the personal side, there’s <a href="/now.html">what I’m doing now</a>, my <a href="/books.html">reading</a>, <a href="/projects.html">projects</a> and <a href="/adventures.html">trips</a>.</p><h2>Keep the conversation going</h2><p>If we share an interest, or you have a thought about something I’ve written, <a href="/contact.html">say hello</a>. You can also find me on <a href="https://x.com/JevanGoldsmith">X</a> and <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/jevan-goldsmith-7b885a185">LinkedIn</a>.</p></div>
    <NewsletterSignup id="about-signup" source="about" />
  </main>
</Base>
